hted and shown on the night clock.</small>␀␀<label>YouTube Data API key</label>␀<input name='apikey' autocapitalize='off' placeholder='␀<h1 style='font-size:17px;margin-top:26px'>Display</h1>␀Switch channels automatically every 10 seconds␀␀Estimated live counts between YouTube's rounded steps (â€œest.â€)␀␀Confetti for milestones (bigger milestones, bigger party)␀␀␀Daily summary on screen at 9 am␀<label>Subscriber race</label><div style='display:flex;gap:8px'>␀␀␀␀<span style='align-self:center'>vs</span>␀␀␀<small>Swipe down twice from the main count to see it. You get an alert if one overtakes the other.</small>␀<label>Night clock (dims and shows the time)</label><div style='display:flex;gap:8px'>␀␀nightStart␀␀<span style='align-self:center'>to</span>␀␀␀nightEnd␀␀␀␀<h1 style='font-size:17px;margin-top:26px'>Weather</h1>␀<label>Town or city</label><input name='wxtown' value='␀' placeholder='e.g. Glasgow'>␀␀␀<small>Long-press the board's screen and pick Weather. Forecasts from Open-Meteo.</small>␀␀␀<h1 id='spotify' style='font-size:17px;margin-top:26px'>Spotify</h1>␀␀␀␀<p style='color:#30d158;margin:0 0 6px'>Connected &#10003;</p>␀␀<small>One-time setup (needs Spotify Premium): go to <b>developer.spotify.com/dashboard</b> &rarr; Create app &rarr; Redirect URI <b>http://127.0.0.1:8888/callback</b> &rarr; tick <b>Web API</b> &rarr; Save. Then copy the Client ID and Client secret here and save.</small>␀␀␀␀<label>Client ID</label><input name='spid' value='␀␀' autocapitalize='off'>␀<label>Client secret</label><input name='spsecret' type='password' autocapitalize='off' placeholder='␀␀␀<small style='margin-top:10px'>Then <a href='#spconnect'>connect your account</a> below the Save button.</small>␀␀␀␀<h1 style='font-size:17px;margin-top:26px'>Motion</h1>␀␀<small style='color:#e62117'>Motion sensor not detected.</small>␀␀␀␀Shake to refresh␀␀␀␀Face-down turns the screen off␀␀Stand it on its side for a tall leaderboard␀Tall leaderboard is upside down? Tick to flip it␀␀␀␀Double-tap the desk for the next channel␀␀␀␀<label>Desk tap sensitivity</label><select name='tapsens'>␀␀edit␀␀␀␀<h1 id='wifi' style='font-size:17px;margin-top:26px'>Wi-Fi networks</h1>␀␀␀␀<small>The board joins your <b>Preferred</b> network when it's in range, otherwise the strongest saved one. <b>Connect now</b> switches straight away.</small><div class='st' style='margin:10px 0'>␀␀␀␀<div style='display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:6px 0;border-top:1px solid #333'><b style='flex:1'>␀␀␀␀</b>␀␀␀␀<span style='color:#30d158'>connected</span>␀␀␀␀<button type='submit' formaction='/wifi/connect?n=␀␀' formnovalidate style='width:auto;margin:0;padding:5px 10px;font-size:13px;background:#2a2a2e'>Connect now</button>␀␀␀␀<span>fixed IP</span>␀␀␀<label style='margin:0'><input type='radio' name='pref' value='␀' style='width:auto'␀␀␀␀> Preferred</label>␀<a href='/settings?edit=␀␀␀␀#wifi'>Edit</a>␀<label style='margin:0'><input type='checkbox' name='rm␀' value='1' style='width:auto'> Remove</label></div>␀␀␀␀<label style='margin:4px 0 0'><input type='radio' name='pref' value='-1' style='width:auto'␀> No preference (strongest signal wins)</label>␀<label>␀Editing: ␀␀␀Add another network (e.g. home)␀Wi-Fi network␀␀␀<button type='button' id='scanBtn' onclick='scan()' style='background:#2a2a2e;margin-top:6px'>&#128246; Scan for networks</button>␀␀<div id='nets' style='margin:8px 0'></div>␀␀<input id='s' name='ssid' value='␀␀␀' placeholder='Network name (tap one above, or type it)'␀␀␀␀<small>Leave blank if you're not adding a network.</small>␀␀<label>Wi-Fi password</label>␀␀␀<input id='pw' name='pass' type='password' autocomplete='off' autocapitalize='off' placeholder='␀␀␀␀'><small><label style='display:inline;margin:0'><input type='checkbox' style='width:auto' onclick="document.getElementById('pw').type=this.checked?'text':'password'"> Show password</label></small>␀␀␀␀<label>Username (only for work Wi-Fi that asks for one)</label>␀<input name='user' value='␀␀' autocapitalize='off' placeholder='Leave blank for normal Wi-Fi'>␀␀<details style='margin-top:18px'␀␀␀␀><summary style='color:#aaa;font-size:14px'>Advanced settings for this network</summary>␀␀␀␀Compatibility mode (Wi-Fi 4 instead of Wi-Fi 6)␀<label>Fixed IP address (blank = automatic)</label>␀<input name='ip' value='␀␀␀␀' placeholder='e.g. 192.168.1.250' inputmode='decimal'>␀<label>Gateway (router) address</label>␀<input name='gw' value='␀␀␀␀' placeholder='e.g. 192.168.1.1' inputmode='decimal'>␀␀␀<label>Subnet mask</label>␀␀<input name='mask' value='␀␀' placeholder='255.255.255.0' inputmode='decimal'>␀␀<label>DNS server</label>␀␀␀<input name='dns' value='␀␀␀' placeholder='e.g. 8.8.8.8' inputmode='decimal'>␀␀␀<small>If this one doesn't answer, the board also tries 8.8.8.8.</small>␀␀␀␀</details>␀␀<button type='submit'>Save &amp; restart</button></form>␀␀␀␀<p style='margin-top:22px'><a href='/update'>&#11014; Update firmware wirelessly</a></p>␀␀␀␀<form id='spconnect' method='POST' action='/spotify/code' style='margin-top:26px'><label>Connect Spotify</label><small>1. <a target='_blank' href='␀'>Open this Spotify link</a> and press Agree.<br>2. Your browser then shows a page that won't load (that's expected). Copy the whole address from the address bar (it starts with http://127.0.0.1:8888/callback?code=...) and paste it here:</small><input name='url' placeholder='http://127.0.0.1:8888/callback?code=...' autocapitalize='off' required><button type='submit' style='background:#1db954'>Connect Spotify</button></form>␀<form method='POST' action='/spotify/disconnect'><button type='submit' style='background:#333;margin-top:8px'>Disconnect Spotify</button></form>␀␀␀␀<form method='POST' action='/calibrate' style='margin-top:22px'><label>Motion calibration</label><small>Put the board in the position you normally use it (on its stand or flat), then press:</small><button type='submit' style='background:#333'>Set this as the normal position</button></form>␀␀</small></div>␀␀<script>scan()</script>␀</body></html>␀␀<small style='margin-top:16px'>Board Wi-Fi MAC address: ␀␀␀␀<h1>␀␀␀␀</h1><p>␀␀␀␀</p><a href='/settings'>Go back</a></div></body></html>␀Calibrated &#10003;␀This is now the board's normal position.␀␀␀␀Unknown network␀That network isn't saved.␀␀␀Switching to ␀␀␀&hellip;␀␀␀␀The board is leaving this network now, so this page will stop updating. Join <b>␀␀␀␀</b> yourself and use the new address shown on the board's leaderboard. If it can't connect, it goes back to the best network it can find.␀␀Spotify disconnected␀␀␀␀You can connect it again any time.␀␀/settings␀␀␀/save␀␀␀/calibrate␀␀/api/data␀␀␀/api/history␀␀␀␀/api/scan␀␀␀/wifi/connect␀␀␀/update␀/spotify/code␀␀␀/spotify/disconnect␀Joined Wi-Fi but got no IP address (DHCP / device approval?)␀␀␀␀Timed out with no reply from the network␀␀␀␀Network found but its security type isn't supported␀Wrong password (the network rejected it)␀␀␀␀Username or password rejected (work/enterprise Wi-Fi)␀␀␀Network not found (out of range or 5 GHz only?)␀Access point refused the board (MAC filter or client limit?)␀␀␀␀Signal too weak or access point stopped responding␀␀Wi-Fi error ␀␀␀␀ (compat)␀␀␀Connecting...␀␀␀Cancelled with BOOT button␀␀no IP␀␀␀Joined Wi-Fi but got no IP address in both Wi-Fi 6 and compatibility mode. Try a fixed IP in Advanced settings, or allow MAC ␀␀␀ on the router/firewall.␀␀␀␀ saved network␀␀ saved networks␀ | ␀, ␀␀Looking for Wi-Fi...␀␀␀␀None of your saved networks are in range (␀␀). Add this one in setup.␀␀␀Wi-Fi failed␀␀␀␀Network: ␀␀␀Board MAC: ␀Opening setup in a few seconds...␀␀␀/tmp.bin␀␀␀␀[␀␀␀,[␀␀i␀␀␀days␀␀␀␀application/json␀␀␀␀low  -  high␀␀␀␀app␀<b style='color:#30d158'>Installed &#10003;</b> The board is restarting &ndash; this page will go back to the dashboard in a few seconds.␀␀␀Updated!␀␀␀␀Restarting...␀␀␀<b style='color:#ff3b30'>Not installed:</b> ␀␀␀␀no file received␀␀␀␀ The board is still running the old version.␀␀␀␀Update failed␀␀␀Can't reach YouTube - check DNS/firewall (␀␀API key not vali